note('s01-god-image','Jung, Psychology and Religion: West and East, CW 11, 2nd ed. (1969; consulted printing 1973), ¶¶144–148; digital PDF pages 80–82. Existing house `jung-1969-psychology-religion-cw11`. ¶144 distinguishes a man-made definition/image from its unknown referent; ¶¶145–148 discuss withdrawal of projections, the dying/self-transforming Christian archetype and those whose faith has faded. ¶102 (digital page 58) supplies the psychological-image/ontological-proof limit. Review-only pending p012 is in S01-LATE-LOCATOR-PATCHES-UNAPPLIED.json; it is unapplied to the frozen source snapshot. '+book_standing)
note('s01-jung-child','Jung, “The Psychology of the Child Archetype,” The Archetypes and the Collective Unconscious, CW 9i, 2nd ed., trans. R. F. C. Hull (Routledge, consulted carrier n.d.), ¶299, print p.178; digital PDF page 189. Source house `jung-cw9i-hull-routledge-second-edition`. Beginning/end and pre-/post-conscious essence were located in the actual scan; OCR drops the leading digit of adjacent paragraph labels. Review-only pending p003 is in S01-LATE-LOCATOR-PATCHES-UNAPPLIED.json, unapplied to the frozen source snapshot. '+book_standing)
